# src/apps/daemon/internal/protocols/arq

## Purpose
Automatic-repeat-request primitives for reliable packet/tunnel delivery.

## Architectural role
- Daemon dependency band: `protocols` (rank 1; lower rank = deeper implementation).
- Cross-band imports may point only to a lower rank. Same-band imports are allowed when they remain within one architectural layer.

